# ==============================================================================
# Enterprise Security Audit Exceptions (ADR: Architectural Decision Records)
# ==============================================================================

# EKS API Public Endpoint & CIDR
# Justification: Remote DevOps administration without costly AWS DirectConnect/Site-to-Site VPN.
# Production IAM RBAC and AWS STS authentication enforce cluster API security.
AVD-AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0041

# EKS Secrets KMS Envelope Encryption
# Justification: FinOps baseline for dev environment. AWS KMS CMK adds monthly fixed costs.
AVD-AWS-0039

# S3 & DynamoDB Customer Managed Key (CMK)
# Justification: FinOps optimization. State is already encrypted at rest via AWS-managed AES256.
AVD-AWS-0132
AVD-AWS-0025

# S3 Bucket Access Logging & VPC Flow Logs
# Justification: Non-production environment. Flow Logs & Access Logging destination S3 ingestion costs are saved.
AVD-AWS-0089
AVD-AWS-0178
